(3286783, 456227, 67152, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little flat for this type of minimalism.  I am sure this would have been much better had you been able to use some PS - especially to bring out the nice clouds.  Maybe a more silhouette type photo would have been more dramatic</td>', 'The lighting is a little flat for this type of minimalism.  I am sure this would have been much better had you been able to use some PS - especially to bring out the nice clouds.  Maybe a more silhouette type photo would have been more dramatic', '2007-01-26 12:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3286788, 458801, 67152, '<td valign="top">the lighting is a little harsh on the stones/candy or whatever they are.</td>', 'the lighting is a little harsh on the stones/candy or whatever they are.', '2007-01-26 12:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3286791, 457780, 64446, '<td valign="top">Good focus, dof and strong colours. Could have cropped a little more, to get rid of the nose and the other eye''s shadow.</td>', 'Good focus, dof and strong colours. Could have cropped a little more, to get rid of the nose and the other eye''s shadow.', '2007-01-26 12:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3286795, 458445, 67152, '<td valign="top">I really like the use of negative space and the warm tones of brown/orange.  Too bad you could not remove them but there are lots of lens dust, specks in this one.  I noticed the same thing on my first try at this entry and had to cleam my whole camera before I could get one decent!</td>', 'I really like the use of negative space and the warm tones of brown/orange.  Too bad you could not remove them but there are lots of lens dust, specks in this one.  I noticed the same thing on my first try at this entry and had to cleam my whole camera before I could get one decent!', '2007-01-26 12:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3286796, 458177, 67152, '<td valign="top">the color and lighting is very nice - but I feel that there is just too much negative space.</td>', 'the color and lighting is very nice - but I feel that there is just too much negative space.', '2007-01-26 12:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3286800, 457574, 67152, '<td valign="top">the lighting is a little flat and does not show off the cool designs in the sand/stones in the foreground.</td>', 'the lighting is a little flat and does not show off the cool designs in the sand/stones in the foreground.', '2007-01-26 12:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3286809, 458400, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the low angle of the light on this - cool textures of the surface are seen clearly</td>', 'i like the low angle of the light on this - cool textures of the surface are seen clearly', '2007-01-26 12:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3286810, 457819, 2490, '<td valign="top">Centered compo doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Centered compo doesn''t work for me.', '2007-01-26 12:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3286815, 457245, 67152, '<td valign="top">Thesnow is too blown out on this.  I like the set up a great deal - low angle on the path, but the exposure needs to be fixed.</td>', 'Thesnow is too blown out on this.  I like the set up a great deal - low angle on the path, but the exposure needs to be fixed.', '2007-01-26 12:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3286824, 458154, 69604, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better with out the hand</td>', 'I think this would have been better with out the hand', '2007-01-26 12:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3286840, 457406, 67152, '<td valign="top">wonderful composition and textures</td>', 'wonderful composition and textures', '2007-01-26 12:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3286987, 455705, 36619, '<td valign="top">excellent focus and white-ness!</td>', 'excellent focus and white-ness!', '2007-01-26 13:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3287052, 456987, 66353, '<td valign="top">Wish you had chosen another surface</td>', 'Wish you had chosen another surface', '2007-01-26 13:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3287075, 458771, 35947, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  10</td>', 'Great shot!  10', '2007-01-26 13:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3287077, 458029, 35947, '<td valign="top">Love the colors!</td>', 'Love the colors!', '2007-01-26 13:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3287079, 455393, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well executed!  10</td>', 'Very creative and well executed!  10', '2007-01-26 13:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3287142, 458659, 29011, '<td valign="top">This is such a neat and creative shot! :)  I see what you had in mind here. The white balance looks just a bit off though. A seperate light for the background could''ve helped it be more white and less gradient but that depends , because the gradient here does work well too, kind of like a sunset of sorts. For the challenge though, having the whites really white without the hue would''ve been perfect.</td>', 'This is such a neat and creative shot! :)  I see what you had in mind here. The white balance looks just a bit off though. A seperate light for the background could''ve helped it be more white and less gradient but that depends , because the gradient here does work well too, kind of like a sunset of sorts. For the challenge though, having the whites really white without the hue would''ve been perfect.', '2007-01-26 13:46:19.000000', NULL, 1);
