(3287995, 457277, 56672, '<td valign="top">Creative.  I usually think of lens flare as a bad thing, but making it the subject is a new idea.</td>', 'Creative.  I usually think of lens flare as a bad thing, but making it the subject is a new idea.', '2007-01-26 16:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
