(3291422, 458252, 69102, '<td valign="top">I really like this the first time I saw it, but didn''t notice the stars in the top of the frame. Kudos on the exposure! Bumped it to a nine. The only thing that kept it from the ten was that I don''t like the house lights and the little bit of light are on the bottom right edge.</td>', 'I really like this the first time I saw it, but didn''t notice the stars in the top of the frame. Kudos on the exposure! Bumped it to a nine. The only thing that kept it from the ten was that I don''t like the house lights and the little bit of light are on the bottom right edge.', '2007-01-27 16:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3291428, 457319, 69387, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge. Gread idea! Sadly the background looks dull so instead of bringing out the subject, it washes it out for me.</td>', 'Meets the challenge. Gread idea! Sadly the background looks dull so instead of bringing out the subject, it washes it out for me.', '2007-01-27 16:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
