(3291833, 455467, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting for a no-editing challenge!    I always have to up the levels inordinately to get this high-key affect on pictures.  great job.<br/> <br/>Adorable subject too by the way :)</td>', 'Beautiful lighting for a no-editing challenge!    I always have to up the levels inordinately to get this high-key affect on pictures.  great job. Adorable subject too by the way :)', '2007-01-27 18:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
