(3292235, 457884, 18738, '<td valign="top">Looks fulfilling to me. But, I don''t see it as being much of a minimalistic photo. Negative space doesn''t make minimalism, it''s just a part of it. But I don''t generally alter my vote on DNMC anyway so you''re fine.</td>', 'Looks fulfilling to me. But, I don''t see it as being much of a minimalistic photo. Negative space doesn''t make minimalism, it''s just a part of it. But I don''t generally alter my vote on DNMC anyway so you''re fine.', '2007-01-27 21:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3292243, 456821, 18738, '<td valign="top">Except one. and where are the pocketfuls of posies?</td>', 'Except one. and where are the pocketfuls of posies?', '2007-01-27 21:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3292252, 455309, 18738, '<td valign="top">It''s not. Mine is. He can get through any maze, in any lab, in the world. Don''t tell anyone though: the government want him dead.</td>', 'It''s not. Mine is. He can get through any maze, in any lab, in the world. Don''t tell anyone though: the government want him dead.', '2007-01-27 21:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3292258, 458825, 18738, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but technically poor. I would have upped the exposure a little to counteract your camera''s metering being fooled by the snow. Also the composition is a little flat. a different angle would be more interesting, maybe give some depth to the dead flowers?</td>', 'nice idea, but technically poor. I would have upped the exposure a little to counteract your camera''s metering being fooled by the snow. Also the composition is a little flat. a different angle would be more interesting, maybe give some depth to the dead flowers?', '2007-01-27 21:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3292312, 455775, 65025, '<td valign="top">The shadow patterns are very interesting, and the sparkle on the snow is nice.  But it seems a little out of focus.</td>', 'The shadow patterns are very interesting, and the sparkle on the snow is nice.  But it seems a little out of focus.', '2007-01-27 22:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
