(3292932, 456006, 43073, '<td valign="top">I don''t see much that is minimal about this image; it also has some issues with exposure and composition (it has a faded look that doesn''t appeal to me), though I like the crossing vertical lines of the reptile with the branch.</td>', 'I don''t see much that is minimal about this image; it also has some issues with exposure and composition (it has a faded look that doesn''t appeal to me), though I like the crossing vertical lines of the reptile with the branch.', '2007-01-28 03:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3292934, 456970, 43073, '<td valign="top">This didn''t strike me as particularly minimal, and the center alignment of the subject didn''t really work for me, either. The other elements (the pole, the people) actually detracted from the minimal effect to my eyes.</td>', 'This didn''t strike me as particularly minimal, and the center alignment of the subject didn''t really work for me, either. The other elements (the pole, the people) actually detracted from the minimal effect to my eyes.', '2007-01-28 03:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3292937, 455362, 43073, '<td valign="top">This seems very busy for a minimalist shot, and the harsh lighting from the window overpowers and washes out the scene.</td>', 'This seems very busy for a minimalist shot, and the harsh lighting from the window overpowers and washes out the scene.', '2007-01-28 03:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3292939, 458456, 43073, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t sure what to think about this shot; it strikes me as anything but minimal, and the subject matter doesn''t really speak to me.</td>', 'I wasn''t sure what to think about this shot; it strikes me as anything but minimal, and the subject matter doesn''t really speak to me.', '2007-01-28 03:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3292942, 458676, 43073, '<td valign="top">Minimal, but with some issues of focus, and I don''t find the lighting particularly appealing (there are no real highlights and only some very soft shadows).</td>', 'Minimal, but with some issues of focus, and I don''t find the lighting particularly appealing (there are no real highlights and only some very soft shadows).', '2007-01-28 03:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3292960, 457784, 43073, '<td valign="top">Minimal, but the placement of the subject doesn''t work for me, and choice of subject isn''t particularly appealing to me, either. I would have made the background black either completely flat or with more texture; I find the one fold toward the left out of place.</td>', 'Minimal, but the placement of the subject doesn''t work for me, and choice of subject isn''t particularly appealing to me, either. I would have made the background black either completely flat or with more texture; I find the one fold toward the left out of place.', '2007-01-28 04:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
