(3292998, 455393, 31443, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the tilt, otherwise like it lots!</td>', 'Too bad about the tilt, otherwise like it lots!', '2007-01-28 05:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3292999, 458643, 69368, '<td valign="top">great color and exellent lighting! - 8 -</td>', 'great color and exellent lighting! - 8 -', '2007-01-28 05:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293001, 458309, 31443, '<td valign="top">The bird against the sun makes this shot very special, nice minimal rendering..</td>', 'The bird against the sun makes this shot very special, nice minimal rendering..', '2007-01-28 05:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293037, 458684, 43073, '<td valign="top">Shadows alone aren''t really minimalism to me, and there''s a lot going on here for me to think of this as a minimalist shot. You''re also (probably unfairly) falling victim to my prejudice against woodies (they do absolutely nothing for me as subject matter, sorry); that said, you did a wonderful job with the lighting on this, showing more than just the bare outline (though I may have actually put the figure behind the frame, as the bits of highlight showing at the bottom are distracting to me); I''m bumping it up a bunch from where I first voted it.</td>', 'Shadows alone aren''t really minimalism to me, and there''s a lot going on here for me to think of this as a minimalist shot. You''re also (probably unfairly) falling victim to my prejudice against woodies (they do absolutely nothing for me as subject matter, sorry); that said, you did a wonderful job with the lighting on this, showing more than just the bare outline (though I may have actually put the figure behind the frame, as the bits of highlight showing at the bottom are distracting to me); I''m bumping it up a bunch from where I first voted it.', '2007-01-28 05:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293040, 456932, 43073, '<td valign="top">Nothing minimalist about this for me, a very busy, confusing shot, though well lit with some nice highlights, the focus seems off to me for the subject matter.</td>', 'Nothing minimalist about this for me, a very busy, confusing shot, though well lit with some nice highlights, the focus seems off to me for the subject matter.', '2007-01-28 05:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293060, 457277, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but for me it didn''t really work; the extra reflections near the flare, the line coming out, and the lone reflection to the right don''t fit together to me.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but for me it didn''t really work; the extra reflections near the flare, the line coming out, and the lone reflection to the right don''t fit together to me.', '2007-01-28 06:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293064, 458832, 43073, '<td valign="top">I was unsure what was going on with this shot; the image on the right (Hendrix?) detracts from the minimalism for me, and turns it into a different kind of shot; the diagonal on the right distracted me from the main subject(s) here.</td>', 'I was unsure what was going on with this shot; the image on the right (Hendrix?) detracts from the minimalism for me, and turns it into a different kind of shot; the diagonal on the right distracted me from the main subject(s) here.', '2007-01-28 06:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293065, 457941, 43073, '<td valign="top">This didn''t work for me; minimal, but with elements that detracted from that for me (the size of the paper, the nail, the texture on the wall).</td>', 'This didn''t work for me; minimal, but with elements that detracted from that for me (the size of the paper, the nail, the texture on the wall).', '2007-01-28 06:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293069, 458082, 43073, '<td valign="top">There was a bit too much going on here for me to think of this as minimal. I also wish the model had been a bit more to the right, so that his hair didn''t get lost on the left side (as you look at him) in the brick.</td>', 'There was a bit too much going on here for me to think of this as minimal. I also wish the model had been a bit more to the right, so that his hair didn''t get lost on the left side (as you look at him) in the brick.', '2007-01-28 06:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293074, 456397, 43073, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot, but it''s not minimal to me (either within the challenge description or within my understanding of the technique).</td>', 'A beautiful shot, but it''s not minimal to me (either within the challenge description or within my understanding of the technique).', '2007-01-28 06:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293077, 458045, 43073, '<td valign="top">The overall look of this shot didn''t appeal to me; the minimalist elements are caught up in the imprecise focus on the ships and problems with contrast in their lights, and the distracting rocks in the lower right corner.</td>', 'The overall look of this shot didn''t appeal to me; the minimalist elements are caught up in the imprecise focus on the ships and problems with contrast in their lights, and the distracting rocks in the lower right corner.', '2007-01-28 06:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293081, 455642, 46314, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really feel that minimalist to me, but I get what you were going for. There is a nice rhythm to the picture.</td>', 'Doesn''t really feel that minimalist to me, but I get what you were going for. There is a nice rhythm to the picture.', '2007-01-28 06:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293082, 456258, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but not much minimal about it to my eyes, the apparent subject is largely out of focus, and I don''t read his face to have the expression you''ve given it in the title (in fact, I can''t tell at all what''s going on here from this shot); the bits of truck or bus to the right are distracting.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but not much minimal about it to my eyes, the apparent subject is largely out of focus, and I don''t read his face to have the expression you''ve given it in the title (in fact, I can''t tell at all what''s going on here from this shot); the bits of truck or bus to the right are distracting.', '2007-01-28 06:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293087, 456352, 43073, '<td valign="top">The different hill layers in this, with the washed out look of both the middle and upper ones, detracted from this shot, and to my eyes made it too busy to be a minimalist shot.</td>', 'The different hill layers in this, with the washed out look of both the middle and upper ones, detracted from this shot, and to my eyes made it too busy to be a minimalist shot.', '2007-01-28 06:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293093, 457819, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but it doesn''t really work for me as an image, and the white reflection just above the center black circle was unfortunate and distracting to my eyes.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but it doesn''t really work for me as an image, and the white reflection just above the center black circle was unfortunate and distracting to my eyes.', '2007-01-28 06:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293097, 455661, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for minimalism. The cat seems a bit murky and blurry though. Maybe the lighting could have been improved?</td>', 'Nice idea for minimalism. The cat seems a bit murky and blurry though. Maybe the lighting could have been improved?', '2007-01-28 06:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293102, 458788, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern and rhythm. Needed a more interesting sky/colour to make it a winner.</td>', 'Nice pattern and rhythm. Needed a more interesting sky/colour to make it a winner.', '2007-01-28 06:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293110, 458798, 43073, '<td valign="top">A very busy image, one that doesn''t seem minimalist to me; the lighting doesn''t work for my eyes, either, as is very harsh across many of the coins, especially the penny.</td>', 'A very busy image, one that doesn''t seem minimalist to me; the lighting doesn''t work for my eyes, either, as is very harsh across many of the coins, especially the penny.', '2007-01-28 06:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293115, 456397, 46314, '<td valign="top">Would have looked better in colour.</td>', 'Would have looked better in colour.', '2007-01-28 06:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293182, 458606, 43073, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on minimalism, but with so much going on in the image, it just doesn''t work for me for this challenge; the framing is a bit off for my eye (I think I would have tried to shoot so that only the right side of the face showed, and none of the left).</td>', 'An interesting take on minimalism, but with so much going on in the image, it just doesn''t work for me for this challenge; the framing is a bit off for my eye (I think I would have tried to shoot so that only the right side of the face showed, and none of the left).', '2007-01-28 07:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293183, 457681, 43073, '<td valign="top">Too much going on here for a minimalist shot in my eyes; I''m not sure I buy the "red" as the subject matter where it''s almost entirely out of the depth of field and so is largely out of focus.</td>', 'Too much going on here for a minimalist shot in my eyes; I''m not sure I buy the "red" as the subject matter where it''s almost entirely out of the depth of field and so is largely out of focus.', '2007-01-28 07:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293184, 458174, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach, but it doesn''t really do much for me, especially with the "extra" shadow at the bottom center and the scattered extra marks. Still, looks better on second look than it did on first (I vote before I comment), so a bump up is warranted.</td>', 'Interesting approach, but it doesn''t really do much for me, especially with the "extra" shadow at the bottom center and the scattered extra marks. Still, looks better on second look than it did on first (I vote before I comment), so a bump up is warranted.', '2007-01-28 07:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293229, 458338, 34192, '<td valign="top">my favorite of the challenge.   Very simple still life with excellent tones.  Light and shadow play wonderfully here - textured wall adds much.  Great composition.</td>', 'my favorite of the challenge.   Very simple still life with excellent tones.  Light and shadow play wonderfully here - textured wall adds much.  Great composition.', '2007-01-28 08:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293232, 455393, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love the tongue in cheek title - goes perfectly with image.  Any other title would not be as effective.  Like the starkness - works with subject.  Focus perfect, tones and composition excellent.</td>', 'I love the tongue in cheek title - goes perfectly with image.  Any other title would not be as effective.  Like the starkness - works with subject.  Focus perfect, tones and composition excellent.', '2007-01-28 08:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293238, 457878, 34192, '<td valign="top">any other hue and I probably would not like this image.  The colors blend so well and give this scene such warmth it would not otherwise have.  It somehow lends it an emotion I don''t get from the dead plant.  The DOF is perfect and also enhances the overall feel of the image.  The only nit is the strange lightened spot over on the bottom right.  Still gets a 9 from me.</td>', 'any other hue and I probably would not like this image.  The colors blend so well and give this scene such warmth it would not otherwise have.  It somehow lends it an emotion I don''t get from the dead plant.  The DOF is perfect and also enhances the overall feel of the image.  The only nit is the strange lightened spot over on the bottom right.  Still gets a 9 from me.', '2007-01-28 08:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293240, 456970, 34192, '<td valign="top">you probably got a hundred DNMC.  But you got a 9 from me.  I love this image.  I love that the dog is the center of attention. I love the lighting and I love the shadows even more.  The cigarette in the persons hand, the diagonals and horizontals and verticals... Oh, and the title.  Great title.</td>', 'you probably got a hundred DNMC.  But you got a 9 from me.  I love this image.  I love that the dog is the center of attention. I love the lighting and I love the shadows even more.  The cigarette in the persons hand, the diagonals and horizontals and verticals... Oh, and the title.  Great title.', '2007-01-28 08:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293244, 457685, 34192, '<td valign="top">humorous entry with good lighting.  Thank you!  Composition works for me.  Colors and focus very good. 9</td>', 'humorous entry with good lighting.  Thank you!  Composition works for me.  Colors and focus very good. 9', '2007-01-28 08:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293248, 458153, 34192, '<td valign="top">This is really cool.  I think you composed excellently.  Tones excellent.  Shadows enhance the image.  great work 9</td>', 'This is really cool.  I think you composed excellently.  Tones excellent.  Shadows enhance the image.  great work 9', '2007-01-28 08:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293251, 456322, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like this.  I''m thinking, did the photographer find this scene?  That would make it intriguing.  Did the photographer create this scene?  That would make it intriguing.  Either way, you have my interest.  Technicals good - color, focus, dof, POV all work for me.  But why?  Why a banana?  Why there?  Who''s gonna slip?  Does it matter? What is it with yellow anyway? 8</td>', 'I like this.  I''m thinking, did the photographer find this scene?  That would make it intriguing.  Did the photographer create this scene?  That would make it intriguing.  Either way, you have my interest.  Technicals good - color, focus, dof, POV all work for me.  But why?  Why a banana?  Why there?  Who''s gonna slip?  Does it matter? What is it with yellow anyway? 8', '2007-01-28 08:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293254, 457941, 34192, '<td valign="top">Yes it is.  Reminds me of Williams'' poem - "Just a note..."  Poignant.  Sometimes simplicity is best.  8</td>', 'Yes it is.  Reminds me of Williams'' poem - "Just a note..."  Poignant.  Sometimes simplicity is best.  8', '2007-01-28 08:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293255, 458763, 34192, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting enhances the subject.  Colors perfect.  Composition works. 8</td>', 'Excellent lighting enhances the subject.  Colors perfect.  Composition works. 8', '2007-01-28 08:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293256, 458154, 34192, '<td valign="top">For me the lighting makes this image.  Very well done.  Simple composition works. 8</td>', 'For me the lighting makes this image.  Very well done.  Simple composition works. 8', '2007-01-28 08:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293259, 458400, 34192, '<td valign="top">the lighting makes this image.  I really like and textured hued background a real plus - great change from all the white.  I like that the paperclip looks used. 8</td>', 'the lighting makes this image.  I really like and textured hued background a real plus - great change from all the white.  I like that the paperclip looks used. 8', '2007-01-28 08:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293260, 457729, 34192, '<td valign="top">very well controlled lighting and focus.  good work. 7</td>', 'very well controlled lighting and focus.  good work. 7', '2007-01-28 08:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293261, 457961, 43073, '<td valign="top">The apparent minimalist focus here -- the elk or deer -- is hardly seeable, and with the remaining subject matter (trees, rocks, sky), it''s hardly a minimalist image; as a photo of wildlife, I would have liked to have seen much more attention paid to the wildlife.</td>', 'The apparent minimalist focus here -- the elk or deer -- is hardly seeable, and with the remaining subject matter (trees, rocks, sky), it''s hardly a minimalist image; as a photo of wildlife, I would have liked to have seen much more attention paid to the wildlife.', '2007-01-28 08:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293263, 458738, 34192, '<td valign="top">color and focus good. simple lighting.  composition a little bland. 6</td>', 'color and focus good. simple lighting.  composition a little bland. 6', '2007-01-28 08:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293264, 458801, 43073, '<td valign="top">Somewhat minimalist, though the lighting doesn''t appeal to me (the reflections being rather harsh to my eyes), and seems to throw the colors off.</td>', 'Somewhat minimalist, though the lighting doesn''t appeal to me (the reflections being rather harsh to my eyes), and seems to throw the colors off.', '2007-01-28 08:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293266, 455467, 34192, '<td valign="top">think the over exposure works for this image. background bland but thats to be expected. composition well done, focus excellent.POV works for me.7</td>', 'think the over exposure works for this image. background bland but thats to be expected. composition well done, focus excellent.POV works for me.7', '2007-01-28 08:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293267, 458575, 43073, '<td valign="top">The moon is overexposed so that it''s a bit blurry and certainly washed out, and the jet exhaust isn''t really juxtaposed against the moon in any noticeable way (they just happened to be in the same sky).</td>', 'The moon is overexposed so that it''s a bit blurry and certainly washed out, and the jet exhaust isn''t really juxtaposed against the moon in any noticeable way (they just happened to be in the same sky).', '2007-01-28 08:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293268, 457952, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like this - it just seems so far away.  The textured ground works for me as do the tones and shadows. 8</td>', 'I like this - it just seems so far away.  The textured ground works for me as do the tones and shadows. 8', '2007-01-28 08:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293269, 455672, 34192, '<td valign="top">Well composed and focused.  Wish there was more shadow - would give it more depth. 6</td>', 'Well composed and focused.  Wish there was more shadow - would give it more depth. 6', '2007-01-28 08:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293271, 458148, 43073, '<td valign="top">This has an abstract (though perhaps not minimalist) flavor to it, but it doesn''t work for me in the end, though I''m not sure if it''s the lack of direct subject in the photo (unless it''s the person, in which case they''re too small and indistinct for my eyes), or the angle (though this does help it be a bit more abstract).</td>', 'This has an abstract (though perhaps not minimalist) flavor to it, but it doesn''t work for me in the end, though I''m not sure if it''s the lack of direct subject in the photo (unless it''s the person, in which case they''re too small and indistinct for my eyes), or the angle (though this does help it be a bit more abstract).', '2007-01-28 08:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293275, 456254, 43073, '<td valign="top">Suitably minimalist, but doesn''t appeal to me as an image; lighting doesn''t add anything to it, so it''s just sort of sitting there.</td>', 'Suitably minimalist, but doesn''t appeal to me as an image; lighting doesn''t add anything to it, so it''s just sort of sitting there.', '2007-01-28 08:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293276, 456915, 43073, '<td valign="top">The extreme contrast here (and the way the branch is washed out) didn''t work for me here; I would have liked to have seen it shot a little more closely, and with exposure set with an eye to bringing out the branch and berries.</td>', 'The extreme contrast here (and the way the branch is washed out) didn''t work for me here; I would have liked to have seen it shot a little more closely, and with exposure set with an eye to bringing out the branch and berries.', '2007-01-28 08:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293277, 458576, 43073, '<td valign="top">This does not work for me; the frog is not sharply in focus, and the lighting is distracting (especially the bright spot and sharp shadow across the top of the frame).</td>', 'This does not work for me; the frog is not sharply in focus, and the lighting is distracting (especially the bright spot and sharp shadow across the top of the frame).', '2007-01-28 08:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293278, 458266, 43073, '<td valign="top">Minimalist, for sure, but not with any apparent message or intent, so left me wondering "why?".</td>', 'Minimalist, for sure, but not with any apparent message or intent, so left me wondering "why?".', '2007-01-28 08:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293282, 458825, 43073, '<td valign="top">Exposure here, and lack of a clear focus took this outside of the minimalist challenge for me; there''s a lot going on, and it''s a bit dark on the whole for my tastes.</td>', 'Exposure here, and lack of a clear focus took this outside of the minimalist challenge for me; there''s a lot going on, and it''s a bit dark on the whole for my tastes.', '2007-01-28 08:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293284, 458826, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Light and shadow work great here.  tones excellent 7</td>', 'I like this.  Light and shadow work great here.  tones excellent 7', '2007-01-28 08:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293285, 458585, 34192, '<td valign="top">excellent lighting for subject.  POV and focus perfect. 7</td>', 'excellent lighting for subject.  POV and focus perfect. 7', '2007-01-28 08:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293286, 456454, 43073, '<td valign="top">Not much minimalist about this; lots of visual activity, some of it distracting, and even the children are quite "busy" in terms of shapes and colors.</td>', 'Not much minimalist about this; lots of visual activity, some of it distracting, and even the children are quite "busy" in terms of shapes and colors.', '2007-01-28 08:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293287, 455775, 43073, '<td valign="top">Not sure what is going on here, though I like the concept a lot; many white spots (not sure what caused them), and generally unattractive lighting for my tastes (mostly greys).</td>', 'Not sure what is going on here, though I like the concept a lot; many white spots (not sure what caused them), and generally unattractive lighting for my tastes (mostly greys).', '2007-01-28 08:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293288, 456284, 34192, '<td valign="top">somehow this works brilliantly.  composition over the top. focus perfect. excellent take on the challenge. 9</td>', 'somehow this works brilliantly.  composition over the top. focus perfect. excellent take on the challenge. 9', '2007-01-28 08:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3293289, 455877, 34192, '<td valign="top">simple composition, in focus, color balance good. its not grabbing me but its well taken. 6</td>', 'simple composition, in focus, color balance good. its not grabbing me but its well taken. 6', '2007-01-28 08:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
