(3293292, 458509, 34192, '<td valign="top">this flower is grabbing me much more than the last one I voted on.  There is a great sense of depth here - missing in some of the other images in the challenge.  I like the light and reflections - think they add to the overall impact.  well taken. 8</td>', 'this flower is grabbing me much more than the last one I voted on.  There is a great sense of depth here - missing in some of the other images in the challenge.  I like the light and reflections - think they add to the overall impact.  well taken. 8', '2007-01-28 08:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
