(3293298, 458721, 34192, '<td valign="top">works for me because of the inclusion of reflection and shadow.  Would be very flat otherwise. no emotional impact - they''re tacks - I would hope not! but well conceived and executed image.</td>', 'works for me because of the inclusion of reflection and shadow.  Would be very flat otherwise. no emotional impact - they''re tacks - I would hope not! but well conceived and executed image.', '2007-01-28 08:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
