(3293761, 455747, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, it does look a bit fake, perhaps you should have made some of the buried stem visible through the snow. Good focus, lighting and detail though.</td>', 'Nice idea, it does look a bit fake, perhaps you should have made some of the buried stem visible through the snow. Good focus, lighting and detail though.', '2007-01-28 13:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
