(3293849, 456277, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good comp and good exposure to accomodate the sky.  Outside of minimal editing, you can bring the foreground out more, but you''ve definitely got the right basic exposure to start with.</td>', 'Good comp and good exposure to accomodate the sky.  Outside of minimal editing, you can bring the foreground out more, but you''ve definitely got the right basic exposure to start with.', '2007-01-28 13:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
