(3293856, 458177, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely minimal.  Very good lighting and exposure, good detail.  May be almost TOO minimal - such a great capture - could have been just a wee bit bigger.</td>', 'Definitely minimal.  Very good lighting and exposure, good detail.  May be almost TOO minimal - such a great capture - could have been just a wee bit bigger.', '2007-01-28 13:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
