(3294552, 457602, 31341, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, perhaps a tad dark, but it also takes up a lot of the image...pushing the minimalistic aspect a little to far.</td>', 'Nice shot, perhaps a tad dark, but it also takes up a lot of the image...pushing the minimalistic aspect a little to far.', '2007-01-28 18:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3294571, 458826, 31341, '<td valign="top">Perhaps I would like this more if I could tell what it is...I struggle trying to figure out what it is rather than enjoying the composition.</td>', 'Perhaps I would like this more if I could tell what it is...I struggle trying to figure out what it is rather than enjoying the composition.', '2007-01-28 18:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3294574, 457878, 31341, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color.</td>', 'Nice composition and color.', '2007-01-28 18:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3294581, 458702, 31341, '<td valign="top">Was this intentionally blurry?  Was it moving, and hence a play on words with the still life?  The wall looks sharp.  I guess I am confused. I''ll give you a few points for trying something different.</td>', 'Was this intentionally blurry?  Was it moving, and hence a play on words with the still life?  The wall looks sharp.  I guess I am confused. I''ll give you a few points for trying something different.', '2007-01-28 18:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
