(3303469, 458799, 45519, '<td valign="top">Minimal subject matter but not really minimalism artistically/photographically.  And while this is a beautifully captured scene nonetheless, it still could use some technical improvement by moving the horizon either up or down ... versus almost right across the middle of the frame.</td>', 'Minimal subject matter but not really minimalism artistically/photographically.  And while this is a beautifully captured scene nonetheless, it still could use some technical improvement by moving the horizon either up or down ... versus almost right across the middle of the frame.', '2007-01-30 14:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
