(3303519, 458720, 45519, '<td valign="top">Excellent light ... and the snow is *perfectly* exposed/captured.  Unfortunately, this looks almost errantly framed or accidentally cropped.  Tilt the camera down 10-degrees and shoot just the snow (as lit/exposed here) and you''ve got a stronger entry IMO.</td>', 'Excellent light ... and the snow is *perfectly* exposed/captured.  Unfortunately, this looks almost errantly framed or accidentally cropped.  Tilt the camera down 10-degrees and shoot just the snow (as lit/exposed here) and you''ve got a stronger entry IMO.', '2007-01-30 15:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
