(3303541, 458509, 45519, '<td valign="top">Nicely spotted ... great composition and light.  I''m wondering if isolating the flower in the upper right corner against only the wet tarmac using a portrait (vertical) orientation and would make this one even stronger, as the snow (salt?) on the left keeps pulling my eye away from the main subject.  When I narrow my browser window to "crop" the image to portrait as described, it really stands out!</td>', 'Nicely spotted ... great composition and light.  I''m wondering if isolating the flower in the upper right corner against only the wet tarmac using a portrait (vertical) orientation and would make this one even stronger, as the snow (salt?) on the left keeps pulling my eye away from the main subject.  When I narrow my browser window to "crop" the image to portrait as described, it really stands out!', '2007-01-30 15:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3303547, 458299, 45519, '<td valign="top">Excellent graphic qualities ... oh what being able to crop would do for this one (to exclude that lampost at bottom and other crosswalk hash in the lower left).</td>', 'Excellent graphic qualities ... oh what being able to crop would do for this one (to exclude that lampost at bottom and other crosswalk hash in the lower left).', '2007-01-30 15:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
