(3316942, 458153, 66097, '<td valign="top">I did not vote on this challenge but as I scanned the images, yours stood out as being very unique from the bunch. I love this. There is a bit of surrealism in this image. I give you a post 10 and congrats on your ribbon, you can now cross that off of a goal. Way to go. Your on a very good start with just 6 entries.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-02 00:43:34.</i></td>', 'I did not vote on this challenge but as I scanned the images, yours stood out as being very unique from the bunch. I love this. There is a bit of surrealism in this image. I give you a post 10 and congrats on your ribbon, you can now cross that off of a goal. Way to go. Your on a very good start with just 6 entries.', '2007-02-02 00:42:08.000000', '2007-02-02 00:43:34.000000', 0),
