(3318260, 457690, 66384, '<td valign="top">Although all of them are nice images, I don''t think any would have scored well in the minimalism challenge, because there is too much in the background. The ones that scored well had very little if any background.<br/> <br/>Challenge aside, I really like this photo - the line of the path, the interaction between the dogs, the colors and textures.</td>', 'Although all of them are nice images, I don''t think any would have scored well in the minimalism challenge, because there is too much in the background. The ones that scored well had very little if any background. Challenge aside, I really like this photo - the line of the path, the interaction between the dogs, the colors and textures.', '2007-02-02 11:05:17.000000', NULL, 0),
