(3319430, 458832, 67145, '<td valign="top">yes i see wot you mean about synchronistic decisions  .. lets hope that in the next few challenges we can actually think like the voters ... i get it wrong most of the time ... <br/>i wasnt even going to enter the photo that i got my personal best in, but i''d put it in my portfolio and judy <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=15711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jutilda</a> left comment saying it''d go well in patterns .. i took it out straight away and submitted it .. all in the space of about half an hour!! ...<br/>i think that a lot of photos i take, and dont even consider putting in challenges, would get blue ribbons .. lol lol lol ...... :)<br/>my shallow dof and free study are both sitting around 5.6000 ish .. and i thought they''d go real well ... i got that wrong ..<br/>however ... i''ve put one in the bad challenge and i''m gonna get blue for sure!!!!!!! lol lol lol  .. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'yes i see wot you mean about synchronistic decisions  .. lets hope that in the next few challenges we can actually think like the voters ... i get it wrong most of the time ... i wasnt even going to enter the photo that i got my personal best in, but i''d put it in my portfolio and judy  jutilda left comment saying it''d go well in patterns .. i took it out straight away and submitted it .. all in the space of about half an hour!! ...i think that a lot of photos i take, and dont even consider putting in challenges, would get blue ribbons .. lol lol lol ...... :)my shallow dof and free study are both sitting around 5.6000 ish .. and i thought they''d go real well ... i got that wrong ..however ... i''ve put one in the bad challenge and i''m gonna get blue for sure!!!!!!! lol lol lol  ..