(3320178, 457591, 45631, '<td valign="top">OK, so I was the only one that didn''t like the shadow.  So let me explain.   I don''t mind the shadow but for the challenge ''minimalism'' I feel that just the fire connection itself with it''s outstanding red colour and shape would have created a much better impact and met the challenge better. I find the shadow distracting my attention from the actual object.  I gave it a 9 at voting - would have been a 10 with no shadow.  Cheers<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-02 18:30:38.</i></td>', 'OK, so I was the only one that didn''t like the shadow.  So let me explain.   I don''t mind the shadow but for the challenge ''minimalism'' I feel that just the fire connection itself with it''s outstanding red colour and shape would have created a much better impact and met the challenge better. I find the shadow distracting my attention from the actual object.  I gave it a 9 at voting - would have been a 10 with no shadow.  Cheers', '2007-02-02 18:29:34.000000', '2007-02-02 18:30:38.000000', 0);
